<name>ND00199 flood strip (approximate)</name>
<description>Approximate screening strip, not a mapped flood extent.
Dam ND00199 (Swan Buffalo Detention 12). Crest 1071.09 ft NAVD88. Peak 28,623 cfs.
Schematic desk valley: max depth 14.53 ft, wet strip 11.07 km, 2323.4 ac.
Downstream direction: the dam line's normal, on the side away from the reservoir point (bearing 131°).
Engine: crest-desk-engine 2026.10.30.

